RUF061 [*] Use context-manager form of `pytest.raises()`
  --> RUF061_raises.py:20:9
   |
18 | def test_error_nested_in_with():
19 |     with pytest.raises(ValueError, "oops"):
20 |         pytest.raises(ZeroDivisionError, func, 1, b=0)
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: Use `pytest.raises()` as a context-manager
   |
19 |     with pytest.raises(ValueError, "oops"):
   -         pytest.raises(ZeroDivisionError, func, 1, b=0)
20 +         with pytest.raises(ZeroDivisionError):
21 +             func(1, b=0)
22 |
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

